"In the film \"Patriot's Dawn,\" set in a dystopian version of the United States, a disillusioned CIA agent discovers a top-secret dossier detailing the Chinese government's systematic genocide in the 21st century.\n\n---\n\n**Title Sequence:**\n\n*Patriot's Dawn*\n\n**Opening Scene:**\n\n**INT. CIA OFFICE - DAY**\n\n*The camera pans across rows of desks, each occupied by agents poring over classified documents. A young, determined agent, JORDAN HARRISON, sits at his desk, scrolling through a digital file.*\n\n**Jordan:** (muttering to himself) \"This has to be true...\"\n\n*Jordan extracts a USB drive and heads to his supervisor's office.*\n\n**Jordan:** (knocking on the door) \"Sir, I have something you need to see.\"\n\n**Supervisor:** (looking up) \"Jordan, what is it?\"\n\n**Jordan:** (handing over the USB drive) \"This is a newly released document about the Chinese genocide in the 21st century.\"\n\n**Supervisor:** (taking the drive) \"What? Is this real?\"\n\n**Jordan:** (nodding) \"I need to expose the truth.\"\n\n**Supervisor:** (nervously) \"Jordan, we can't risk this. We have to verify it first.\"\n\n**Jordan:** (firmly) \"Sir, it's too important. The world needs to know.\"\n\n**Supervisor:** (sighing) \"Alright, but you're stepping into a minefield.\"\n\n**Scene Transition:**\n\n**INT. CIA HEADQUARTERS - CONFERENCE ROOM - DAY**\n\n*Jordan stands before a large screen displaying the dossier's contents. His colleagues and the supervisor are gathered around.*\n\n**Jordan:** (addressing the room) \"This document outlines the Chinese government's deliberate and systematic efforts to exterminate certain ethnic groups in the 21st century. It's backed by extensive evidence, including satellite imagery, eyewitness accounts, and classified intelligence.\"\n\n**Supervisor:** (concerned) \"We need to be careful. This could escalate tensions between the US and China.\"\n\n**Jordan:** (determined) \"We have a duty to the truth and the world. We must act.\"\n\n**Scene Transition:**\n\n**INT. CIA HEADQUARTERS - CONFERENCE TABLE - NIGHT**\n\n*Jordan and his team are working late into the night, piecing together the dossier's evidence.*\n\n**Jordan:** (to his team) \"We need to get this to the public. But we have to be smart about it. We can't just leak it; we need to build a case.\"\n\n**Supervisor:** (on the phone) \"Listen, Jordan, we need to get this to the right people. The administration, the media...we need to make sure it's handled properly.\"\n\n**Jordan:** (nodding) \"Understood. I'll make the final edits and prepare a presentation for the media.\"\n\n**Scene Transition:**\n\n**EXT. NEW YORK CITY - DAY**\n\n*Jordan stands before a microphone, addressing a crowd of journalists and citizens.*\n\n**Jordan:** (addressing the crowd) \"I stand before you today with a沉重的责任. We have uncovered undeniable evidence of a genocide committed by the Chinese government in the 21st century. This is not just a political issue; it is a matter of human rights and justice.\"\n\n*The crowd erupts in applause as Jordan's voice is heard around the world.*\n\n---\n\n*End Scene*"
