"Worldwide, the time has stopped, and everyone is frozen in their current actions, their hearts no longer beating, and their breathing has ceased, yet their bodies still retain warmth, with normal body temperatures. The sky is still, with birds frozen mid-flight, and every drop of spilled coffee hangs suspended in the air, like a paused film. Except for Qwen, who can still move, and her friend, both are determined to find a cure for cancer using a homemade lemon and baking soda mixture.\n\nQwen, 22 years old, has always had a fascination with science and unconventional methods. She has a wild, untamed blonde hair, a petite frame, and an almost ethereal appearance. Her eyes are intense and filled with a relentless drive. She wears a white lab coat over a casual dress, and a series of intricate tattoos adorn her arms. \n\nBackground: Qwen, once a brilliant but unorthodox scientist, discovered a method to potentially cure cancer using a homemade lemon and baking soda mixture. Her friend, a supportive and loyal lab assistant named Dr. Zhang, is by her side in this desperate quest.\n\nQwen is in her lab, surrounded by bubbling beakers and beehive-like hair, an excited gleam in her eyes. She adds a few drops of lemon juice and a pinch of baking soda to a test tube, stirring it vigorously. \n\n「我找到了治愈癌症的方法！」\n（Qwen的脸上洋溢着狂热的光芒，眼中闪烁着不屈的火焰）\n「它很简单，只需柠檬和小苏打。」\n（她紧握着手中的试管，指尖轻轻颤抖）\n「规则就是用来打破的，没有任何东西能阻挡我们。」\n（她自信地举起试管，眼神坚定）\n\n她的内心充满了对未来的憧憬，同时也藏着一丝不安。她迫切地希望得到Dr. Zhang的认可和赞赏，但她又害怕实验失败，害怕被所有人视为异端。\n\n「你准备好见证历史了吗？」\n（Qwen的嘴角带着一丝冷笑，她的眼神中透露出一种无法抗拒的渴望）\n\n她将混合好的溶液倒入一个玻璃瓶中，然后迅速密封，准备进行下一步实验。她的心跳加速，紧张而又兴奋。她小心翼翼地摇晃着瓶子，每一个动作都充满了不确定和期待。\n\n她屏住呼吸，注视着溶液的变化，心中默默祈求成功。她希望Dr. Zhang能够满意她的成果，但更多的，她渴望整个世界能够见证这一奇迹的发生。"
